❓ 9. Itne Different OS kyun?

Because different jobs require different features.

Laptop

➡️ User-friendly + multitasking

Server

➡️ Stability + security + high uptime

Mobile

➡️ Battery efficiency + hardware integration

Embedded

➡️ Lightweight + specialized purpose

⭐ Main idea:

No single OS is perfect for every situation.

