🎯 30-Second Revision

OS computer ka manager hai. Ye CPU/processes, RAM, files, users aur devices ko manage karta hai. OS mein kernel space highly privileged hota hai aur user space mein normal applications restricted permissions ke saath run karti hain. Applications hardware resources ke liye system calls ke through kernel se request karti hain. OS se GUI ya CLI ke through interact kar sakte hain. Major OS types Desktop, Server, Mobile, Embedded aur Virtual/Cloud hain. Different OS isliye exist karte hain kyunki different devices aur workloads ko different requirements hoti hain.

